OL,3,GNEWSALack of parking 'may well finish
OL,4,Aus off'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner has warned a lack of
OL,7,Fparking included in a major housing
OL,8,Fdevelopment "may well finish us off".
OL,10,FGloucester's only residential tower
OL,11,Fblock, Clapham Court, is set to be
OL,12,Fdemolished in the next six months s and
OL,13,Freplaced with 34 new homes.
OL,15,FThe scheme, developed by Gloucester
OL,16,FCity Homes (GCH), will provide 21
OL,17,Fparking spaces, with other residents in
OL,18,FAlvin Street currently sharing 10
OL,19,Froadside spaces.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
